{
  "_comment": "Every setting each RAG node's methods offer, with the default its settings form fills in, and where each method runs. The *Settings.test.ts files keep this in step with RetrievalMethodSchemas.tsx, ChunkMethodSchemas.tsx and RerankMethodSchemas.tsx. tests/test_*_settings_matter.py (server) and those same TS files (browser) then require a test showing each setting changes what the method does, so a setting that silently does nothing fails the build. null means the form has no default.",
